<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices- Oct 14.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices- Oct 14.</headline>
<text>
<p>DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   114/116   119/121     UNQ     221/223</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  115/117   120/122   210/220   230/235</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunker prices ended lower tracking cargo prices as inventories remained healthy and supplies were ample, traders said on Monday. A 2,000 tonne 180-cst parcel was traded at $121 delivered, a major said late Monday.  MDO prices were steady, indicated between $210-$220 and gas oil was also stable at $230-$235.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
</text>
